WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:02,020
I said, I have to make a report when I speak

2
00:00:02,020 --> 00:00:05,590
You can only speak and report with my permission.

3
00:00:05,590 --> 00:00:08,980
Tell me, what's the matter, boss?

4
00:00:08,980 --> 00:00:13,330
I want to ask how much longer we need to stand before we can rest

5
00:00:13,330 --> 00:00:18,500
How about standing till meal time?

6
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:21,560
Who just said he could stand for a day?

7
00:00:21,560 --> 00:00:29,650
I didn't expect that just standing would make me so tired.

8
00:00:29,650 --> 00:00:35,110
Do you want to ask if this light standing alone is of no use to you?

9
00:00:35,110 --> 00:00:37,110
Why are you standing like this?

10
00:00:37,110 --> 00:00:38,110
very simple

11
00:00:38,110 --> 00:00:40,180
Exercise your willpower

12
00:00:40,180 --> 00:00:41,180
i know

13
00:00:41,180 --> 00:00:43,180
Many of you would love to say that you have great willpower

14
00:00:43,180 --> 00:00:45,180
Not even afraid of death

15
00:00:45,180 --> 00:00:51,480
But I want to say that not being afraid of death has nothing to do with willpower

16
00:00:51,480 --> 00:00:54,480
What I call willpower here is willing yourselves

17
00:00:54,480 --> 00:00:57,860
stress tolerance

18
00:00:57,860 --> 00:00:59,860
and the ability to persevere
